luding stacks (المداخن), cranes (الرافعات) and construction equipment (معدّات الإنشاء).", "payload": {"row": {"assessment": "contractual_post_award", "confidence": "medium", "confidence_reason": "Read from the governing Arabic image (reading pending approval); wider than the English convenience translation of note (1), which omits temporary structures, cranes and construction equipment.", "discipline": "construction", "group": "height-of-structures", "id": "ADD-03-T5-1-NOTE-1-APPLICABILITY", "interpretations": [{"consequence": {"class": "contractual", "quote": "تسري هذه الحدود على جميع المنشآت الدائمة والمؤقتة، بما في ذلك المداخن والرافعات ومعدّات الإنشاء.", "unit": "ADD-03:p4-image/note1"}, "quote": "١. تسري هذه الحدود على جميع المنشآت الدائمة والمؤقتة، بما في ذلك المداخن والرافعات ومعدّات الإنشاء.", "stage": "ADD-03"}], "requirement": "The Table 5-1 height limits apply to all permanent and temporary structures, including stacks, cranes and construction equipment (Table 5-1 note 1, Appendix A, Arabic text governing).", "scope": ["site"], "units": ["ADD-03:p4-image/note1"]}}, "provision": "ADD-03:p4-image/note1", "state": {"activity_templates_sha256": "8f720c1d04e5f6d1926872e7bdeca2e28537782912cdc237796e2fe98e30d005", "amendments_sha256": "cec31d3931c953f5505c6db86b1f5b1b73e8b52e3817b7c29c409ea616489cca", "assumptions_sha256": "be5a1ecc966dab8d311cb4688827e56b9cd41f28053de21b5fb262fea446b1e0", "base_candidate_sha256": null, "base_run": null, "curation_sha256": "2cdf3faa6c1aed208a7e7fc24b6ca69c8a329fe41ffd4faa409c2cc5cc6c93b6", "decisions_sha256": null, "evidence_build_id": "42e9285d5bfded97af9ab513d9a46102db87cdf17e0adf53f00718536633cef4", "pack_id": "NUPA-ISTP-2026-014+ADD-03-CANDIDATE", "readings_sha256": "0a9b8da903aded9ca0e91f05236a016f4f0c4c03d12c31caab5e2dfd66e5ff39", "register_sha256": "8fa0072209651dfb94d0862e5cac287415c02ac8c85d7e02f0404990aa647ff5", "relationships_sha256": "1e6f35c25cd34a8718fff3d6ac2a8ce8b86821e3211c270742a64caa9b4c3052", "unrecorded_crops_sha256": null, "validated_stage": "ADD-02", "working_stage": "ADD-03"}, "statement_type": "row_new", "statements": ["F1", "F2", "F5", "I1", "I3"], "target": "ADD-03:p4-image/note1"}, {"evidence": [{"crop_sha256": "5791ba2b8a837d19dd693dd88e5046c347d3ac811b43e969449bf8a4a8be3d5d", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/note1", "words": "١. تسري هذه الحدود على جميع المنشآت الدائمة والمؤقتة، بما في ذلك المداخن والرافعات ومعدّات الإنشاء."}, {"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 5, "unit_id": "ADD-03:T5-1/note(1)", "words": "These limits apply to all permanent structures, including stacks."}, {"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 3, "unit_id": "ADD-03:7.2", "words": "The Arabic text governs."}], "id": "ADD-03/p4-image/note1/issue", "model_rationale": "Crop b10-full: 'الدائمة والمؤقتة' (permanent and temporary) and 'والرافعات ومعدّات الإنشاء' (cranes and construction equipment) are printed; the English note omits them.", "payload": {"owner": "Construction Manager", "short": "Table 5-1 note 1: Arabic includes temporary structures, cranes and construction equipment", "text": "Scope of Table 5-1 note 1 differs between languages: the governing Arabic note applies the height limits to all permanent and temporary structures including stacks, cranes and construction equipment, whereas English note (1) of Appendix B reads 'These limits apply to all permanent structures, including stacks.' Under ADD-03 Section 7.2 the Arabic governs, so crane and lifting plans and construction methodology must respect the zone limits (25 m Zone A, 40 m Zone B); this bears on the crane and lifting content of the Technical Proposal.", "theme": "height of structures"}, "provision": "ADD-03:p4-image/note1", "state": {"activity_templates_sha256": "8f720c1d04e5f6d1926872e7bdeca2e28537782912cdc237796e2fe98e30d005", "amendments_sha256": "cec31d3931c953f5505c6db86b1f5b1b73e8b52e3817b7c29c409ea616489cca", "assumptions_sha256": "be5a1ecc966dab8d311cb4688827e56b9cd41f28053de21b5fb262fea446b1e0", "base_candidate_sha256": null, "base_run": null, "curation_sha256": "2cdf3faa6c1aed208a7e7fc24b6ca69c8a329fe41ffd4faa409c2cc5cc6c93b6", "decisions_sha256": null, "evidence_build_id": "42e9285d5bfded97af9ab513d9a46102db87cdf17e0adf53f00718536633cef4", "pack_id": "NUPA-ISTP-2026-014+ADD-03-CANDIDATE", "readings_sha256": "0a9b8da903aded9ca0e91f05236a016f4f0c4c03d12c31caab5e2dfd66e5ff39", "register_sha256": "8fa0072209651dfb94d0862e5cac287415c02ac8c85d7e02f0404990aa647ff5", "relationships_sha256": "1e6f35c25cd34a8718fff3d6ac2a8ce8b86821e3211c270742a64caa9b4c3052", "unrecorded_crops_sha256": null, "validated_stage": "ADD-02", "working_stage": "ADD-03"}, "statement_type": "issue", "statements": ["F1", "F5", "I3"], "target": "ADD-03:T5-1/note(1)"}], "state": {"activity_templates_sha256": "8f720c1d04e5f6d1926872e7bdeca2e28537782912cdc237796e2fe98e30d005", "amendments_sha256": "cec31d3931c953f5505c6db86b1f5b1b73e8b52e3817b7c29c409ea616489cca", "assumptions_sha256": "be5a1ecc966dab8d311cb4688827e56b9cd41f28053de21b5fb262fea446b1e0", "base_candidate_sha256": null, "base_run": null, "curation_sha256": "2cdf3faa6c1aed208a7e7fc24b6ca69c8a329fe41ffd4faa409c2cc5cc6c93b6", "decisions_sha256": null, "evidence_build_id": "42e9285d5bfded97af9ab513d9a46102db87cdf17e0adf53f00718536633cef4", "pack_id": "NUPA-ISTP-2026-014+ADD-03-CANDIDATE", "readings_sha256": "0a9b8da903aded9ca0e91f05236a016f4f0c4c03d12c31caab5e2dfd66e5ff39", "register_sha256": "8fa0072209651dfb94d0862e5cac287415c02ac8c85d7e02f0404990aa647ff5", "relationships_sha256": "1e6f35c25cd34a8718fff3d6ac2a8ce8b86821e3211c270742a64caa9b4c3052", "unrecorded_crops_sha256": null, "validated_stage": "ADD-02", "working_stage": "ADD-03"}, "statements": [{"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 3, "unit_id": "ADD-03:7.2", "words": "Table 5-1 is issued in the Arabic language. The Arabic text governs."}], "id": "F1", "kind": "fact", "text": "ADD-03 Section 7.2 states that Table 5-1 is issued in Arabic and that the Arabic text governs; the English translation at Appendix B is for convenience only."}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 2, "unit_id": "ADD-03:7.1", "words": "The Project Company shall comply with the height limits in Table 5-1, which is reproduced at Appendix A to this Addendum as issued by the Northern Region Airspace Safeguarding Office and is incorporated into this Volume by reference."}], "id": "F2", "kind": "fact", "text": "ADD-03 Section 7.1 inserts new Volume II Clause 5.6 requiring compliance with the height limits in Table 5-1, reproduced at Appendix A and incorporated by reference."}, {"evidence": [{"crop_sha256": "c32f5643cdf613b17dfc55f78c3d94bf20f179077952fa01fb2c27ddee1bbc77", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/th-left", "words": "الحدّ الأقصى للارتفاع (متر فوق منسوب الأرض الطبيعية)"}], "id": "F3", "kind": "fact", "text": "The Arabic column heading of the height column in Appendix A prints the datum as metres above natural ground level."}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 5, "unit_id": "ADD-03:T5-1", "words": "Maximum height (m above finished ground level)"}], "id": "F4", "kind": "fact", "text": "The English translation (Appendix B) prints the height column as metres above finished ground level."}, {"evidence": [{"crop_sha256": "5791ba2b8a837d19dd693dd88e5046c347d3ac811b43e969449bf8a4a8be3d5d", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/note1", "words": "١. تسري هذه الحدود على جميع المنشآت الدائمة والمؤقتة، بما في ذلك المداخن والرافعات ومعدّات الإنشاء."}, {"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 5, "unit_id": "ADD-03:T5-1/note(1)", "words": "These limits apply to all permanent structures, including stacks."}], "id": "F5", "kind": "fact", "text": "Arabic note 1 of Appendix A extends the limits to all permanent and temporary structures including stacks, cranes and construction equipment; English note (1) of Appendix B mentions only permanent structures including stacks."}, {"evidence": [{"crop_sha256": "09a3078ef437190f19726553a346ad22fedebf26b1bd4448cdff863bb10ccd24", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/row-a-right", "words": "٢٥ الجزء من الموقع الواقع ضمن مسافة ١٬٥٠٠ متر من الحدّ الشرقي للموقع أ"}, {"crop_sha256": "ba4894a1b73be496eae1d04c58d7601bb2dd73300450491cea8905db6736a4d5", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/row-a-left", "words": "مطلوبة"}, {"crop_sha256": "fd6db8574955d4396dbcf30ee012074635fbe11cfea8d74908b251db1b40b11a", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/row-b-left", "words": "مطلوبة لأي جزء يزيد ارتفاعه على ٣٠ متراً ٤٠"}, {"crop_sha256": "28b9ebd0c59a6ac1dd4a4d7e2141302861643fc2aee2e2e47031cf57cd45313e", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/row-b-right", "words": "باقي مساحة الموقع ب"}], "id": "F6", "kind": "fact", "text": "Appendix A row A prints Zone A (the part of the site within 1,500 m of the eastern site boundary) with maximum height 25 and warning lighting required; row B prints Zone B (remainder of the site) with maximum height 40 and warning lighting required for any part exceeding 30 m."}, {"id": "I1", "kind": "interpretation", "text": "The Appendix A cells and notes are the governing content of Table 5-1 that new Volume II Clause 5.6 (ADD-03:7.1, another batch) incorporates; they amend no volume unit themselves (no_effect for the amendment engine), so their obligations are recorded as register rows on the addendum's own units (row_new), and headings and zone labels that carry no obligation of their own are no_effect."}, {"id": "I2", "kind": "interpretation", "text": "Because the Arabic text governs (F1), heights in Table 5-1 are measured above natural ground level (F3), not finished ground level as the English convenience translation prints (F4)."}, {"id": "I3", "kind": "interpretation", "text": "Because the Arabic text governs (F1), the Table 5-1 limits apply to temporary structures, cranes and construction equipment as well as permanent structures and stacks (F5), wider than English note (1)."}]}, "run_id": "ADD-03-host-20261005T213419Z-aa78", "ts": "2026-10-05T21:34:19Z"}
